@startuml E-Commerce Database Architecture
!define TABLENAME(name) class name << (T, #FFCCCC) >>
!define PRIMARY_KEY(x) <b><u>PK:</u> x</b>
!define FOREIGN_KEY(x) <b><u>FK:</u> x</b>

' Tablas del sistema
TABLENAME(categories) {
    {field} PRIMARY_KEY(category_id): INTEGER
    {field} name: VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL
}

TABLENAME(products) {
    {field} PRIMARY_KEY(product_id): INTEGER
    {field} name: VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL
    {field} description: TEXT
    {field} price_regular: DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL
    {field} price_sale: DECIMAL(10,2)
    {field} stock: INTEGER DEFAULT 0
    {field} FOREIGN_KEY(category_id): INTEGER
    {field} is_on_sale: BOOLEAN DEFAULT false
    {field} sale_start_date: DATE
    {field} sale_end_date: DATE
    {field} image_url: VARCHAR(255)
    {field} sku: VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE
    {field} brand: VARCHAR(100)
    {field} created_at: DATETIME AUTO
    {field} updated_at: DATETIME AUTO
}

TABLENAME(users) {
    {field} PRIMARY_KEY(id): INTEGER
    {field} name: VARCHAR(255)
    {field} email: VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL
    {field} password_hash: VARCHAR(255)
    {field} role: VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'user'
    {field} address: VARCHAR(500)
    {field} phone: VARCHAR(50)
    {field} lat: DECIMAL(10,8)
    {field} lng: DECIMAL(11,8)
}

TABLENAME(carts) {
    {field} PRIMARY_KEY(cart_id): INTEGER
    {field} FOREIGN_KEY(user_id): INTEGER
    {field} created_at: DATETIME AUTO
    {field} updated_at: DATETIME AUTO
}

TABLENAME(cart_items) {
    {field} PRIMARY_KEY(id): INTEGER
    {field} FOREIGN_KEY(cart_id): INTEGER
    {field} FOREIGN_KEY(product_id): INTEGER
    {field} quantity: INTEGER DEFAULT 1
    {field} unit_price: DECIMAL(10,2)
}

TABLENAME(orders) {
    {field} PRIMARY_KEY(order_id): INTEGER
    {field} FOREIGN_KEY(user_id): INTEGER
    {field} total: DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL
    {field} tax: DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL
    {field} status: VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'pendiente'
    {field} created_at: DATETIME AUTO
    {field} updated_at: DATETIME AUTO
}

TABLENAME(order_items) {
    {field} PRIMARY_KEY(id): INTEGER
    {field} FOREIGN_KEY(order_id): INTEGER
    {field} FOREIGN_KEY(product_id): INTEGER
    {field} quantity: INTEGER NOT NULL
    {field} unit_price: DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL
    {field} created_at: DATETIME AUTO ⭐ análisis de ventas
}

TABLENAME(hero_slides) {
    {field} PRIMARY_KEY(slide_id): INTEGER
    {field} title: VARCHAR(255)
    {field} subtitle: TEXT
    {field} button_text: VARCHAR(100)
    {field} button_link: VARCHAR(255)
    {field} image_url: VARCHAR(255)
    {field} display_order: INTEGER DEFAULT 0
}

' Relaciones
categories "1" --> "N" products : has_many\nFK: category_id
products "1" --> "N" cart_items : in_cart
products "1" --> "N" order_items : in_order

users "1" --> "1" carts : has_one
users "1" --> "N" orders : places

carts "1" --> "N" cart_items : contains
cart_items "N" --> "1" products : references

orders "1" --> "N" order_items : contains
order_items "N" --> "1" products : references

note right of categories
    Categorías de productos
    Ej: Electrónica, Accesorios
end note

note right of products
    Catálogo de productos
    - Control de stock
    - Precios regular/oferta
    - Metadata: SKU, marca
end note

note right of users
    Usuarios del sistema
    Roles: user, admin
    - Datos de contacto
    - Coordenadas GPS (lat/lng)
end note

note right of carts
    Carritos persistentes
    (complementa req.session.cart)
    1 por usuario autenticado
end note

note right of cart_items
    Items en carrito activo
    Guarda precio al agregar
end note

note right of orders
    Órdenes confirmadas
    Estados: pendiente, procesando,
    enviado, entregado, cancelado
end note

note right of order_items
    Detalles de cada orden
    ⭐ Incluye created_at para
    análisis de ventas por fecha
end note

note right of hero_slides
    Slides del carrusel
    principal (homepage)
    Editable desde admin
end note

' Leyenda
note bottom
    **Convenciones:**
    PK = Primary Key (clave primaria)
    FK = Foreign Key (clave foránea)
    AUTO = Timestamp automático
    ⭐ Campo importante para análisis
    
    **Flujo principal:**
    User → Cart → CartItems → (Checkout) → Order → OrderItems
    
    **Timestamps activos:**
    - products: created_at, updated_at
    - orders: created_at, updated_at
    - carts: created_at, updated_at
    - order_items: created_at ⭐ (para análisis de ventas)
end note

@enduml
